{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is a plain sink with one requirement, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/receive(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which is given","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a batch of records, oldest first. Delivering is a chain of operators over a tracker’s records:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"batch()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gathers them into batches of 20, and every 30 seconds while any are pending, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"deliver(to:batchBufferLimit:bufferDropReporter:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" hands each batch to every destination as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lazy unit of work that runs once you call ","type":"text"},{"code":"execute()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each destination receives its batches in order, one at a time, from a buffer of its own, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"slow one delays only itself. A full buffer drops its oldest batch and reports it as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". When the tracker has a store, the delivery reads the dropped batch’s records","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"back for that destination once it catches up, and tells the store when each batch has reached","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every destination.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What a destination receives is narrowed by modifiers: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/accepting(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent categories it serves, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/redactingSensitiveValues()"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/droppingCallSite()"},{"type":"text","text":", and added to by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/enriched(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which runs an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"type":"text","text":" on the records that destination alone receives. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints each event, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the newest records it receives for the app to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read, in a debug view or a test."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Logs, traces and servers have destinations in modules of their own, so an app links only the ones","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it uses: ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggerDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"SpanEventDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"TracingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Uploader: Destination {","    func receive(_ batch: [EventRecord]) async {","        \/\/ Send the batch, and return once it is somewhere it won't be lost.","    }","}","","let inspector = try InMemoryDestination(capacity: 500)","let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records","    .batch(strategy: .count(20))","    .deliver(","        to: Uploader().accepting(.analytics).redactingSensitiveValues().droppingCallSite(),","        inspector","    )","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","let received = inspector.events(of: SignedUp.self)  \/\/ [SignedUp(plan: \"pro\")]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The umbrella guide on this area is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","title":"Destinations","externalID":"Destinations","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Destinations","title":"Destinations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InvalidCapacity"]},{"anchor":"Delivering